OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy with the chance
OL,6,Fof a few light showers, these mainly
OL,7,Facross the east. Best of any sunnier
OL,8,Fbreaks across the west. Light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening and
OL,11,Fnight with a few light showers, these
OL,12,Fmainly in the east. Any cloud breaks
OL,13,Facross the west will lead to patchy
OL,14,Ffrost and fog.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FLittle change, remaining
OL,17,Frather cloudy with a few light
OL,18,Fshowers, these mainly in the east.
OL,19,FBrighter across the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
